<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654889475" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngetung Nilai Wujud Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654968998">Ing sawetara tuladha pungkasan, kita nggawe wujud aljabar luwih prasaja nganggo urutan ngetung. Saiki kita bakal ngetung nilai sawetara wujud aljabar—uga manut urutan ngetung. <emphasis effect="bold">Ngetung nilai wujud aljabar</emphasis> tegese nggoleki nilai wujud aljabar nalika variabele diganti nganggo wilangan tartamtu.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654969001">
<title>Ngetung Nilai Wujud Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655161751"><term id="term-00018">Ngetung nilai wujud aljabar</term> tegese nggoleki nilai wujud aljabar nalika variabele diganti nganggo wilangan tartamtu.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655353204">Kanggo ngetung nilai wujud aljabar, ganti variabele nganggo wilangan kuwi, banjur gawe wujude luwih prasaja.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654889272">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654889274">
<problem id="fs-id1170655154711">
<para id="fs-id1170655154713">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655177952">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424830192"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167836329359" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar ana rong kolom, pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing kiwa, tulisan unine “Nalika x padha karo 5.” Ing tengen ana wujud 7x dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore ana wujud nganggo 5 minangka gantine x: 7, bukak kurung, 5, tutup kurung, dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Pingna.” Ing tengen ana wujud 35 dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Kurangi.” Ing tengen ana angka 31, yaiku wujud prasaja saka wujud aljabar mau."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836295066" alt="Tulisan 'nalika x = 5' ditampilake ing latar putih, lan angka 5 diwenehi warna abang samar."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829597558" alt="Ana wujud matematika '7x-4' ing latar putih, isine angka 7, variabel x, tandha kurang, lan angka 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833076771" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 7 dipingake karo 5, banjur asile dikurangi 4, ditulis 7(5)-4. Angka 5 diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836554298" alt="Gambar nuduhake '35-4', tulisane klawu peteng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangi.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836507263" alt="Angka '31' katon cetha ing pojok tengen ndhuwur ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
<para id="fs-id1167829683833"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167833047529" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar ana rong kolom, pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing kiwa, tulisan unine “Nalika x padha karo 1.” Ing tengen ana wujud 7x dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore ana wujud nganggo 1 minangka gantine x: 7, bukak kurung, 1, tutup kurung, dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Pingna.” Ing tengen ana wujud 7 dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Kurangi.” Ing tengen ana angka 3, yaiku wujud prasaja saka wujud aljabar mau."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829597755" alt="Tulisan 'nalika x = 1' ditampilake ing latar putih, lan angka 1 diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836492302" alt="Ana wujud matematika '7x-4' ing latar putih, isine angka 7, variabel x, tandha kurang, lan angka 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836296392" alt="Wujud matematika unine '7(1)-4', angka 1 diwenehi warna abang sing cetha."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836294733" alt="Wujud 7-4 ditampilake ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangi.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833014906" alt="Katon saka cedhak angka 3 sing gedhé, wernane klawu peteng ing latar putih resik."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654936461" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654920156">
<problem id="fs-id1170654920158">
<para id="fs-id1170655196807">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654913926">
<para id="fs-id1170654913929"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 13 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 5</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654968085" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654928390">
<problem id="fs-id1170654928392">
<para id="fs-id1170654928394">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941204">
<para id="fs-id1170655068157"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 8 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 16</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655213474">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655213476">
<problem id="fs-id1170655213478">
<para id="fs-id1170655129489">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> etungen nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943583">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424780807"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167829717426" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar ana rong kolom, pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing larik kapisan, kolom kiwa kosong lan ing tengen ana suku x kuadrat. Ing larik sabanjure, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Ganti x nganggo 4.” Ing tengen ana suku 4 kuadrat. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Nganggoa definisi eksponen.” Ing tengen ana wujud 4 ping 4. Ing larik paling ngisor, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Gawe luwih prasaja.” Ing tengen ana angka 16, yaiku asile nalika x diganti nganggo 4."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
<entry/>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167826170152" alt="Gambar nuduhake tulisan 'Ganti x nganggo 4.', jinise sans-serif klawu, lan angka 4 diwenehi warna abang ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_011a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry align="center"><media id="fs-id1167836526102" alt="Katon saka cedhak angka 4 gedhé, wernane abang, sing dipangkatake 2."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_011b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Nganggoa definisi eksponen. </entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gawe luwih prasaja.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
<para id="fs-id1167836730046"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167836504155" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar ana rong kolom, pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Larik kapisan nuduhake wujud asli sing pangkate isih variabel, ana ing kolom tengen. Ing larik sabanjure, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Ganti x nganggo 4.” Ing tengen ana suku 3 pangkat 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Nganggoa definisi eksponen.” Ing tengen ana wujud 3 ping 3 ping 3 ping 3. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Gawe luwih prasaja.” Ing tengen ana angka 81, yaiku nilai wujud aljabar nalika x diganti nganggo 4."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
<entry/>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mtext>x</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829692365" alt="Tulisan 'Ganti x nganggo 4.' ditampilake kanthi cara digital. Tembung-tembunge wernane klawu peteng, nanging angka 4 diwenehi warna abang jingga lan diterusake titik klawu peteng. Latare putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_012a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry align="center"><media id="fs-id1167836692989" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 3 pangkat 4, ditulis 3^4, kanthi 3 minangka wilangan dhasar lan 4 minangka eksponen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_012b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Nganggoa definisi eksponen.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gawe luwih prasaja.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655120535" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655120539">
<problem id="fs-id1170655202547">
<para id="fs-id1170655202549">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> etungen nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654965432">
<para id="fs-id1170654931966"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>64</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655353747" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655353751">
<problem id="fs-id1170655133647">
<para id="fs-id1170655133650">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> etungen nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655126552">
<para id="fs-id1170654958705"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>216</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>64</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655171250">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655171252">
<problem id="fs-id1170655171254">
<para id="fs-id1170654957369">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655200587">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1169149281503"><table id="fs-id1169148881010" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar ana rong kolom, pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing tengen ndhuwur ana wujud 2 ping x kuadrat ditambah 3x ditambah 8. Siji larik ing ngisore, tulisan ing kiwa unine “Gunakna x padha karo 4.” Ing tengen ana wujud 2, bukak kurung, 4, tutup kurung, kuadrat, ditambah 3, bukak kurung, 4, tutup kurung, ditambah 8. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa unine “Manuta urutan ngetung.” Ing tengen ana wujud 2, bukak kurung, 16, tutup kurung, ditambah 3, bukak kurung, 4, tutup kurung, ditambah 8. Ing ngisore ana wujud 32 ditambah 12 ditambah 8. Ing ngisore ana 52, yaiku nilai wujud aljabar nalika x diganti nganggo 4.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><media id="fs-id1169149357522" alt="Tulisan 'Gunakna x = 4.' ditampilake, angka 4 diwenehi warna abang."><image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_013a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><media id="fs-id1169149089480" alt="Wujud matematika nuduhake 2 ping 4 kuadrat ditambah 3 ping 4 ditambah 8, ditulis 2(4)^2 + 3(4) + 8, tulisane ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_013b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Manuta urutan ngetung.</entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655160606" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655160609">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942304">
<para id="fs-id1170654942306">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655209422">
<para id="fs-id1170655209424">40</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655197213" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197217">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163499">
<para id="fs-id1170655163501">Etungen nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655106382">
<para id="fs-id1170655106384">9</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>